   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "From a difficulty to a proposal",
     "texto": [
      "A clear work proposal can follow four steps: describe the difficulty, explain its effect, propose an action and say how the result will be reviewed. **Jeg foreslår at vi prøver dette i to uker** («I propose that we try this for two weeks») uses **foreslå at** followed by a clause with subject and verb.",
      "To assess the idea without presenting it as certain, you can use **Det kan gjøre arbeidsflyten enklere** («It may make the workflow easier»). **Ta hensyn til** introduces a factor that must also be considered."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
